<title>UK: German inland gas oil steady, touch more buying.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil steady, touch more buying.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.6730)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     34.00/34.30     20.32/20.50   34.00/34.30</p>
<p> BREMEN		34.00/34.30     20.32/20.50   34.00/34.30</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    33.60/34.00     20.08/20.32   33.60/34.00</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   34.00/34.20     20.32/20.44   34.00/34.20</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   33.90/34.10     20.26/20.38   33.90/34.10</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  34.70/35.00     20.74/20.92   34.70/35.00</p>
<p>German inland gas oil was steady on Tuesday amid marginally more buying interest. &quot;Its a bit colder in much of Germnay and buyers have been reminded that its not summer yet,&quot; said one trader. Prices were also held to balance the stronger dollar.</p>
</text>
